      "intelligence_compromised": "The surface exposure at Fort Liberty, with a composite base exposure score of 78, propagates through linked entities such as the 'Joint Special Operations Command', '82nd Airborne Division', and '525th Military Intelligence Brigade'. This exposure could reveal operational patterns, troop movements, and readiness levels of these units. For instance, fitness app heatmaps with a score of 78/100 could indicate the physical training routines of the '82nd Airborne Division', while aircraft tracking with a score of 71/100 might expose flight patterns associated with the 'Joint Special Operations Command'. Such information, when combined, could provide adversaries with insights into the operational tempo and deployment readiness of these units, which they couldn't deduce from any single source alone.",
